{"id":"agstafacay","qid":"Q2352098","category":"river","type":"hydronym","names":{"az":"Ağstafaçay","ru":"Агстев","en":"Aghstev"},"coordinates":[45.4362,41.2401],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"qazax-tovuz","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q275744","az":"Ağstafa rayonu","en":"Aghstafa District"},{"qid":"Q389381","az":"Qazax rayonu","en":"Gazakh District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Ağstafaçay — Kür çayının sağ qolu. Əsasən Ermənistandan və Azərbaycanın Qazax və Ağstafa rayonunun ərazisindən keçir. Uzunluğu 133 km, hövzəsinin sahəsi 2589 km²-dir. Başlanğıcını Kiçik Qafqazın şimal-şərq hissəsindən, Pəmbək sıra dağlarından götürür.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Агсте́в, Акстафа́ или Агстафа (Акстафачай, Акстафинка; арм. Աղստև, азерб. Ağstafaçay) — река в Армении и Азербайджане, правый приток Куры. Длина 121 км, площадь бассейна 2500 км².\nБерёт начало на территории Армении, на около горы Тежлер — одной из вершин Памбакского хребта. Генеральным направлением течения реки является северо-восток. В верховьях Агстев — горная река, текущая в узком лесистом ущелье, несколько расширяющемся у города Дилижан. Ниже протекает в более широкой долине. Впадает в Куру около Кёлхалфали.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Aghstev (Armenian: Աղստև, romanized: Aghstev) or Aghstafa (also, Aghstafachay (Azerbaijani: Ağstafaçay)) is a river in Armenia and Azerbaijan, and a right tributary of the Kura. It is 121 km (75 mi) long, and has a 2,500 km2 (970 sq mi) drainage basin. Along the river lie the cities of Dilijan, Ijevan in Armenia and Gazakh and Aghstafa in Azerbaijan.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Agstev3.JPG/960px-Agstev3.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Agstev3.JPG/960px-Agstev3.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":600,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Agstev3.JPG","title":"Agstev3.JPG","artist":"Ліонкінг","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q2352098: Aghstev","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2352098","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Ağstafaçay","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=A%C4%9Fstafa%C3%A7ay&oldid=8832255","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/A%C4%9Fstafa%C3%A7ay","revid":8832255,"revDate":"2026-04-24","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Агстев","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%90%D0%B3%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B2&oldid=151365311","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%90%D0%B3%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B2","revid":151365311,"revDate":"2026-01-25","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Aghstev (river)","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Aghstev_(river)&oldid=1374491133","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aghstev_(river)","revid":1374491133,"revDate":"2026-09-12","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC 